# dismember_peeler (kenshi-h2v.13.3; docs/reference/SCENARIO_IMPORT.md "peeler="). The peeler's whole sequence (rwh42 5): the occupant's armour is destroyed piece by piece, then
# Left Arm, Right Arm, Left Leg, Right Leg are torn off (each leaves a limb item at the body), then Head, Stomach, Chest, then the cage lets go.
# STAND-IN: the Heft slave shop's cage marked a peeler (`peeler=1`): no loaded zone or layout places the original's Peeler Machine (kenshi-h2v.13 follow-up).
# The player is never ordered; nothing is: the prisoner is the player's own.
KSCEN 2
scenario title=The%20stand-in%20peeler setup=The%20Wanderer%20stands%2038%20u%20from%20the%20Heft%20slave%20shop%20cage%3B%20a%20prisoner%20of%20your%20squad%2C%20in%20armour%2C%20is%20locked%20in%20it%20and%20the%20cage%20is%20marked%20a%20skin%20peeler%20(a%20stand-in%20for%20the%20original%20Peeler%20Machine%2C%20which%20is%20not%20placed%20in%20our%20world). look_for=Just%20watch%2C%20and%20speed%20time%20up%3A%20the%20whole%20sequence%20is%20about%204%20game%20minutes%20at%20the%20original's%20rates%20(1%20HP%20per%20game%20second%20per%20part)%2C%20which%20are%20not%20changed.%20STAND-IN%3A%20this%20is%20the%20Heft%20slave%20shop's%20cage%20marked%20as%20a%20skin%20peeler%2C%20not%20the%20original's%20Peeler%20Machine%20(no%20loaded%20zone%20places%20one).%20Watch%20the%20caged%20prisoner.%20(1)%20Its%20worn%20armour%20is%20destroyed%20one%20piece%20at%20a%20time%2C%20about%2025%20s%20in%20all%2C%20with%20no%20wound%20while%20any%20remains.%20(2)%20Then%20the%20four%20limbs%20wear%20down%20together%20and%20come%20off%20at%20about%203.5%20min%20(the%20original%20wears%20all%20four%20at%20once%2C%20so%20they%20part%20at%20the%20same%20moment%3B%20the%20items%20are%20made%20in%20the%20order%20Left%20Arm%2C%20Right%20Arm%2C%20Left%20Leg%2C%20Right%20Leg)%2C%20each%20leaving%20one%20severed%20limb%20on%20the%20ground%20at%20the%20body.%20(3)%20Head%2C%20Stomach%20and%20Chest%20are%20worked%20once%20no%20limb%20has%20health%20left%20(about%202%20min%20in)%2C%20never%20severed.%20(4)%20At%20about%204%20min%20the%20cage%20lets%20go%20of%20the%20body.%20Does%20a%20severed%20limb%20lie%20on%20the%20ground%20for%20each%20of%20the%20four%2C%20and%20is%20the%20body%20released%3F%20Known%3A%20our%20death%20line%20is%20the%20torso%20line%2C%20so%20the%20prisoner%20ends%20dead%20(the%20original's%20rule%20there%20is%20unmeasured). bead=kenshi-h2v.13 metrics=player_downed_s
